1. **No.** The corrected coordination gap is positive on **26/30** dates and negative on **4/30**. The negative dates are 2026-01-06 (-0.075%), 2026-01-19 (-0.070%), 2026-03-09 (-0.265%), 2026-04-30 (-0.230%).

