/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-STATUS-2026-09-10.md:2:A single readable state of the project. Every number below has a receipt in a dated record in this directory. `DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_CLAIM` throughout: nothing sealed was modified today except one false provenance comment, and no training or policy run was authorised.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-STATUS-2026-09-10.md:7:This is **contract §C3**, the neutral-source substitution contrast: for a named route, its training source is replaced by a neutral one while all heads are retained, updated and deployed. It is **not** §C4, which the contract itself heads *coordination attribution, beyond the source claim*. I conflated the two all day; that is erratum 14.
