    50	
    51	- **The decomposition bake-off** — needed only if the routes are individually dead after the
    52	  representation is repaired. Both candidates' targets derive from the same physics layer, so
    53	  it costs no new physics. Trigger: both runs report and at least one route is ~0 on the
    54	  repaired representation.
    55	- **Extending past 500 epochs** — trigger: outcome 3.
    56	- **Head output-scale calibration** — trigger: outcome 4.
    57	
    58	## What no outcome licenses
    59	
    60	None of these branches is chosen by whether it improves a contrast. Each is triggered by a
    61	**diagnosis** — flat versus moving, representation-bound versus ceiling-bound, scale versus
    62	information — and each diagnosis is stated here before any number exists. The 48 evaluation
    63	dates remain untouched by every branch above.

