   145	
   146	The residual subtracts measured tape, row, fallback-comparison, training, rule setup, online selection, and realisation times from total wall time. It includes small shard/report overhead, so it is a conservative measurement of plan preparation, not a pure profiler sample. The dominant cost is no longer the four chosen outcomes; it is the deliberately reviewable, unoptimised repeated proposal repair, catalogue construction, guard evaluation, and learned scoring.
