   148	Let:
   149	
   150	- `A` = caller-declared anchors per learner seed per rule;
   151	- `S` = caller-declared learner seeds;
   152	- `E` = caller-declared source epochs;
   153	- `W` = worlds;
   154	- `R=2` provisioning rules, `P=9` panel arms, and `L=8` learned arms.
