/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-DECISIONS-COMPUTE-BUDGET-2026-09-08.md:6:2. **Catalogue size cap (decision 4 refined):** pairwise joint moves are restricted to the top-K = 10 users by nominal unilateral surplus **and their top-2 legal options each** (≤ 45 × 4 = 180 rows); unilateral rows ≤ users × legal options (≈ 2 700); evacuation sets ≤ active beams (≈ 40); S0 proposals ≤ 200. Catalogue ≤ ≈ 3 200 rows per anchor.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-NOVELTY-CLOSED-2026-09-10.md:5:No paper in the corpus provisions power to a nominal, unfaded threshold. Every one puts the fade **inside** the quantity that must clear the threshold. Applying a fade quantile downstream of the power solve appears nowhere. And the 1.7 dB implementation margin is a different kind of quantity that cannot stand in for a fade margin.
