codex
The tape build is the slow fixed cost; no second Python process has been started. While it runs, the code trace already establishes that V0.25 dynamically creates one equal-airtime slot per beam member and never rejects a user for occupancy—so the 1.65 W/ACM behavior is a soft service limit, not admission.
